<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Problem loading page</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      body { background: #1a1a1a; color: #f0f0f0; }
    }
    main {
      max-width: 28rem;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem 2rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 32px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
      border: 1px solid #ececec;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      main { background: #232323; border-color: #333; }
    }
    h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 1rem; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
    p { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1.05rem; opacity: 0.95; }
    .actions { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
    button {
      background: #2D9191;
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px 0 rgba(229,115,115,0.08);
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    button:hover, button:focus {
      background: #1CB8B8;
      outline: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
      <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="22" stroke="#2D9191" stroke-width="3" fill="#ecf5f5"/>
      <path d="M24 14v12" stroke="#2D9191" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <circle cx="24" cy="32" r="2" fill="#2D9191"/>
    </svg>
    <h1>Something went wrong</h1>
    <p>The page could not be loaded.<br>Try again in a moment. If the problem continues, contact ScreenConnect support.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <button onclick="location.reload()">Reload Page</button>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
